**The remainder of this document consists of questions that you must complete for this assignment**, as you normally would for a homework assignment. **There are seven questions in total**, which ask you to grade and comment on the AI-generated data analysis exam. Specifically, each question asks you to grade and comment on **one or two** answers from the exam; so, please read each question carefully.

